with the same \code{b} prefix. When the data don't say which cohort a
\code{b}-prefixed column belongs to -- no \code{"Wave"} column, no
\code{"LASA_wave"} provenance attribute, and a name the label database
documents for several cohorts -- it is read as wave B.
